## Project Scaffold

- This is a **Next.js App Router** project with **strict TypeScript**.
- All packages are installed and managed by **pnpm**. During development, for any external packages to be installed — give just the pnpm command in plain text and execute the command yourself.
- Stack: **Next.js (App Router) + TypeScript + Redux Toolkit (for all unified clear statemanagement and RTK Query for all api calls, caching out of the box) + Vanilla CSS (Strictly no TailwindCSS) + Motion + Base UI (for the primitives and then build on top of it) + MUI Icons + ECharts + Auth0/Okta {for authentication}.**

## File Placement — Zero Ambiguity

Every file type has exactly ONE home. DO NOT deviate:

| You are writing a...                | PUT it in...                  | Named as...                                            |
| ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |
| UI primitive (Button, Input, Modal) | `src/components/ui/[Name]/`   | `[Name].tsx` + `[Name].module.css` + `[Name].types.ts` |
| Any other component                 | `src/components/[Name]/`      | `[Name].tsx` + `[Name].module.css` + `[Name].types.ts` |
| Redux slice                         | `src/features/[featureName]/` | `[featureName]Slice.ts`                                |
| Redux selectors                     | `src/features/[featureName]/` | `[featureName]Selectors.ts`                            |
| RTK Query API                       | `src/features/[featureName]/` | `[featureName]Api.ts`                                  |
| Zod schema + TS type                | `src/schemas/`                | `[noun].schema.ts`                                     |
| Custom hook                         | `src/hooks/`                  | `use[Name].ts`                                         |
| Utility function                    | `src/utils/`                  | `[name].ts`                                            |
| 3rd party client init               | `src/lib/`                    | `[name].ts`                                            |
| Page / route                        | `src/app/[route]/`            | `page.tsx` + `page.module.css` + `page.types.ts`       |
| Static asset                        | `public/`                     | DO NOT create `src/assets/`                            |
| Redux store init                    | `src/store/`                  | `store.ts`                                             |

